      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاقَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Poverty,</i> (S, O, K,) <i>want,</i> or <i>need.</i> (S,
O, Msb, K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ ذُو فَاقَةٍ</span> <i>He is one
who is in</i> [<i>poverty</i> or] <i>want</i> or <i>need.</i> (Msb.) (See
8.] It has no (unaugmented] verb. (TA.)

